The deposited files media holds, one directory per project shortcode. CPE reads them through its
bytes port (LiveDepositedFiles in areas/access/media/store).

0803/config.kdl: the CPE configuration of project 0803 (incunabula): its site, labels, pages and the
remodel {} block the store builder reads, in the language docs/src/cpe/config-language.md defines.
0803/narrative/: the editorial texts the configuration names, one Markdown file per text and language
(de, en).
Both are hand-authored and edited in place, never generated.

Source
