                   cpe/projects/incunabula/narrative/
  repository:      dasch-swiss/dsp-incubator, at commit d68f214bf50c8999e1c7750160822ffa063a5c33

They came into this repository as areas/access/cpe/projects/incunabula/config.kdl and narrative/ with
the store builder (DEV-7465), and DEV-7511 and DEV-7512 moved them here. A change is made here; the
incubator follows when it re-vendors. A change to the remodel {} block changes Incunabula's store, which
cpe-server's Incunabula store pins hold; a narrative file the configuration names and media does not
hold leaves the project not ready.

0803/curation.csv: the curation of project 0803 (incunabula), which CPE reads against sync's snapshot
of the project: what the project's editors authored about single resources. One row per resource,
138 lines with the header. Hand-authored: it is edited in place by a person and never regenerated.
It was areas/access/sync/data/0803-curation.csv, served inside sync's snapshot, until DEV-7511 and
DEV-7512 moved it here.

